					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5254</guid>
				<title>SCP-5254</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5254</link>
				<description>

&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: right;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SCP-5254&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Object class: Euclid&lt;br /&gt;
Security level: 4&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Special Containment Procedures:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SCP-5254 is to be kept under 500&amp;#160;MW UV rays, SCP-5254&#039;s containment chamber is to be guarded by three security guards at all times and is not to be let out. SCP-5254 is to be doused in liquid state mercury as to prevent it from breaching containment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Description:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SCP-5254 is a creature that was found in the basement of a house situated in ██████,██████&lt;br /&gt;
and is not to be entered by any personnel unless sent to guard SCP-5254 or to feed SCP-5254 a Class-D personnel. If SCP-5254 has already been fed or the guards have already arrived, they are to be terminated immediately for trying to access classified information. In the event of a containment breach, all personnel are to equip 5&amp;#160;MW UV lamps and protective gear to nullify attacks from SCP-5254.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SCP-5254 is weak to lights, causing its containment chamber to have a light source of 32 watts infrared lighting, if SCP-5254 is caught in a light of 700&amp;#160;MW or higher, it will freeze in place making containment easy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If an electrical blackout occurs all personnel are to grab a 5&amp;#160;MW lights and form the ancient Rome formation testudo (Latin for tortoise) and keep in that formation until the electrical blackout is resolved.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footer-wikiwalk-nav&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;#171; &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5253&quot;&gt;SCP-5253&lt;/a&gt; | SCP-5254 | &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5255&quot;&gt;SCP-5255&lt;/a&gt; &amp;#187;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;by &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/brodsneav&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=7093111&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1607398546&quot; alt=&quot;Brodsneav&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=7093111)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/brodsneav&quot;  &gt;Brodsneav&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
