				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5188</guid>
				<title>SCP-5188</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5188</link>
				<description>

&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: right;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;scp-image-block block-right&quot; style=&quot;width:50;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i.imgur.com/a/wlMmiUN&quot; style=&quot;width:50;&quot; alt=&quot;wlMmiUN&quot; class=&quot;image&quot; /&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;scp-image-caption&quot; style=&quot;width:50;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SCP-5188 being observed by cameras&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Item #:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5188&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Object Class:&lt;/strong&gt; KETER OH GOSH RUN&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Special Containment Procedures:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5188&#039;s cell door must be chained by 10 heavy padlocks, have a 5 digit access code, a level 4 card reader, and voice and oral recognition. NOBODY is allowed into SCP-5188&#039;s cage &lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;UNDER ANY CIRCUMSTANCES&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; (See incident 5188-A-1).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;All level 2 and below must stay 100 feet away from SCP-5188. There must be 5 heavily armed guards, with direct access to the MTF and RRT.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Description:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5188 is a standard amazon box, with no anomalous effects. SCP-5188&#039;s anomalous affects only trigger when touched. When touched, SCP-5188 will suddenly sprout human arms and legs, through the bottom. It looks like a mother████ing cardboard spider. SCP-5188 will then undergo a rage state, where it will kill everything in its path by [DATA EXPUNGED] them.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Exactly 69 seconds (1 minute and 9 seconds) after a human is killed, more &amp;quot;cardboard spiders&amp;quot; drag them away. They then appear again, with their face taped to the cardboard box. These spiders manifest only when SCP-5188 kills someone, therefore they are dubbed SCP-5188-1, and are to be treated as such.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;INCIDENT-5188-A-1:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;blockquote&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dr. ███:&lt;/strong&gt; D-████, please approach SCP-5188.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;D-████ approaches the box, and stands in front of it&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dr. ███:&lt;/strong&gt; Please touch it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;D-████:&lt;/strong&gt; Y&#039;know, that doesnt seem like a good idea.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dr. ███:&lt;/strong&gt; I said please touch SCP-5188. We talked about not following rules earlier. This is why you are here. Now touch SCP-5188&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;D-████ touches SCP-5188&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;D-████:&lt;/strong&gt; Hey that wasnt so ba-&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;[DATA EXPUNGED]&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dr. ███:&lt;/strong&gt; That was horrifying. Well now to write down the results.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;The carboard spider crawls around, then jumps on the viewing glass&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dr. ███:&lt;/strong&gt; THE ████? Is this normal? Ill write this down.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Dr. ███ writes something down. The carboard spider following him on the glass&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dr. ███:&lt;/strong&gt; Hey wait, whats that? Move it ████ spider.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Dr. ███ promptly hits the glass, and the cardboard spider falls off. He then sees something coming out of the shadows&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dr. ███:&lt;/strong&gt; Hey! What the heck? I only remember putting in 1 test subject! Wait, thats not a human&amp;#8230;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;It crawls out and appears to be a manifestation of SCP-5188 (SCP-5188-1)&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dr. ███:&lt;/strong&gt; Another one? This isnt good. This is very bad oh nonono I have to get out.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Dr. ███ is starting to exit the viewing room, when he pauses&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dr. ███:&lt;/strong&gt; What? Its taking his body? Hm&amp;#8230;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;5 seconds pass&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dr. ███:&lt;/strong&gt; OH ████ ITS WEARING HIS FACE AND ITS ████ING SMILING AT ME! ITS ████ING SMILING! WHAT THE F-&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;SCP-5188 jumps through the glass and tackles Dr. ███. It then proceeds to&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;[DATA EXPUNGED]&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;[REDACTED]&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;[REDACTED]&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Now nothing is left in the cell, except for a lot of blood, and a empty cardboard box&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footer-wikiwalk-nav&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;#171; &lt;a class=&quot;newpage&quot; href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5187&quot;&gt;SCP-5187&lt;/a&gt; | SCP-5188 | &lt;a class=&quot;newpage&quot; href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5189&quot;&gt;SCP-5189&lt;/a&gt; &amp;#187;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;by &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/duccy-boi&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=7059423&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1607398547&quot; alt=&quot;Duccy boi&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=7059423)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/duccy-boi&quot;  &gt;Duccy boi&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
