&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;I told him in various simple terms that he could either figure it out or I would shoot him in the balls. He nodded and told me that wasn&#039;t necessary, he could solve it.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
